r hen denken, beïnvloedt daardoor ook hun eigen keuzes. Het vierde Bridgerton-verhaal onderzoekt hoe vertrouwde verhoudingen veranderen wanneer mensen elkaar anders gaan bekijken dan hun publieke reputatie doet vermoeden.","source_type":"official_publisher","source_name":"juliaquinn.com","source_url":"https://juliaquinn.com/international/romancing-mr-bridgerton-netherlands/","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789022590898","key":{"isbn_13":"9789022590898"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":969100060,"title":"De hand van de gravin","isbn_13":"9789022590898","isbn_10":"9022590895","language":"nld","publisher":"Meulenhoff Boekerij B.V.","open_library_edition_id":null,"id":969200108}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789022590898","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789022590898"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-10-31T20:50:00Z","review_batch":"nl-followup-007-20261031","evidence":[{"url":"https://juliaquinn.com/international/to-sir-phillip-with-love-6/","checkedAt":"2026-10-31","fact":"Reviewed content for original Dutch summary; not a copied publisher blurb"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1547069/de-hand-van-de-gravin.html","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T20:24:50.575Z","fact":"Exact ISBN/title/format/publisher/cover binding; language requires exact-edition evidence","sha256":"fc8113802e1d9195b3f8f7b96013d329dc2a53d5dbd9b5fb5fad51cdc0338837"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000530163_De_hand_van_de_gravin_2_710_130_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31T21:39:13.538Z","http":200,"sha256":"336dd58cf59d333597c90290b439709d4b2241329b015ad23d91dba69b07b4ec","bytes":98362,"fact":"Decoded and visually inspected31Oct2026 on contact sheets1/2: same verified edition jacket/title/author, readable710px width, original aspect, no crop or arbitrary resize URL. Filename130 is NOT actual pixel height."},{"reviewNote":"No conflicting identity or format evidence found in revie